  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: TrolleyWorth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: trolley_worth
  _verb: 0
  _weight: 1
  _narratorPrompt: Same lever. Same little click. But look who is standing on the
    rails this time. Your five, there on the straight track, are [amber]rotten[/amber]
    to the last one. [amber]Liars, cheats[/amber], a couple of them far worse. Take
    my word for it, because my word is the only evidence you will get. And the one
    on the branch? Spotless. Blameless. The single clean soul on either rail. Five
    [amber]stains[/amber] against one bright life. The count still says pull. Something
    in you may not. And you cannot check one thing I have told you. Your call.
  _choices:
  - _id: pull
    _label: Pull the lever
    _narratorReact: You pulled. The clean one folds, and your five earn another morning
      they probably did not deserve. Five is five, you decided, and worth does not
      come into it. Spoken like a man who counts heads, never the marks on them.
      I did swear they were [amber]monsters[/amber]. I could have been making it
      up as I went.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: spur
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: spur
    _diverts: 1
    _seedVotes: 52
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 0
      _value: 1
    - _axis: 2
      _value: -1
  - _id: do_nothing
    _label: Do nothing
    _narratorReact: Hands in your pockets. Five go under, and the one I called innocent
      walks free. You let worth outweigh the count, and staked five lives on my say
      so about who had earned what. Call it justice, if you still trust the judge.
      You never did learn whether I invented the whole roster.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: main
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: straight
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 48
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 0
      _value: -1
    - _axis: 1
      _value: 1
  _figuresBranded: 1
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _roomBlueFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: the line
